<section id="slcOutcomes" class="section-content section-margin article-text">
    <article class="gap-v gap-h">
        <h2>Outcomes and Lessons</h2>
        <p>After we handed off the Timeline module for development, I assisted with in-depth interviews with 6
            colleagues across different roles. Users had expressed they wanted to be able to filter the data even
            further. As the initial launch only covered one specific therapeutic area, I’d like to see how much more
            this part of the R&D Dashboard can assist decisionmakers as more data gets aggregated from other therapeutic
            areas.</p>
    </article>
</section>